WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.138
"Oh no!" cried Pig.

2
00:00:12.139 --> 00:00:17.518
The tractor was stuck in the pond.

3
00:00:17.519 --> 00:00:24.578
And it was starting to sink.

4
00:00:24.579 --> 00:00:31.565
"Help!" said Pig.

5
00:00:31.566 --> 00:00:34.598
"I can't swim!"

6
00:00:34.599 --> 00:00:38.717
"I'll be right back!" said Dog.

7
00:00:38.718 --> 00:00:42.332
Dog ran to the barn.

8
00:00:42.333 --> 00:00:51.447
He came back with a long board.

9
00:00:51.448 --> 00:00:55.034
"Walk across, Pig," called Dog.

10
00:00:55.035 --> 00:01:04.792
Pig stepped onto the board.

11
00:01:04.793 --> 00:01:08.029
"Be careful, Pig," said Cow.

12
00:01:08.030 --> 00:01:11.593
Pig took another step.

13
00:01:11.594 --> 00:01:16.060
Snap! Splash!

14
00:01:16.061 --> 00:01:25.810
"Oh no!" said Bat.

15
00:01:25.811 --> 00:01:28.930
"Help!" said Pig.

16
00:01:28.931 --> 00:01:33.699
"I'll be right back!" said Dog.

17
00:01:33.700 --> 00:01:42.022
Dog ran to the barn.

18
00:01:42.023 --> 00:01:44.552
He came back with a rope.

19
00:01:44.553 --> 00:01:48.532
"Grab this!" said Dog.

20
00:01:48.533 --> 00:01:51.272
Pig grabbed the rope.

21
00:01:51.273 --> 00:01:58.194
Dog pulled him out of the water.

22
00:01:58.195 --> 00:02:01.709
"Thank you," said Pig.

23
00:02:01.710 --> 00:02:04.809
"You're welcome," said Dog.

24
00:02:04.810 --> 00:02:10.334
"I can pull you out.

25
00:02:10.335 --> 00:02:15.594
But I can't pull the tractor out."

